{"romaji": "Yi Fei Chong Tian: Tianji Zhang Qi", "english": "Dragon Lancer"}, "format": "TV", "description": "In pursuit of the cosmic criminal (genius scientist) Jigu, Qinglong, captain of the Galactic Garrison, relentlessly pursues him. However, during a battle with Jigu, he falls into a trap and inadvertently ends up on Earth.<br><br>\n\nOn Earth, Qinglong befriends a kind and righteous young boy named Tianyi. Unexpectedly, Jigu also follows them to Earth, and upon discovering its adbundant biodiversity, decides to modify Earth's creatures to create his own army.<br><br>\n\nTo Top Jigu's invasion plan, Qinglong, Tianyi, and their companions embark on a new journey to maintain peace on Earth.<br><br>\n\n(Source: IQIYI, translated)", "startDate": {"year": 2015, "month": 1}, "endDate": {"year": 2015, "month": 3}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 52, "duration": 23, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Comedy", "Mecha"], "tags": []}]}}}